'''Suddenly Suicune (Part 2)''' (Japanese: '''VS スイクンII''' ''VS Suicune II''), titled '''Suicune (Part 2)''' in the [[Chuang Yi]] translation, is the 131st chapter of the [[Pokémon Adventures]] manga, and the 41st chapter of the {{MangaArc|Gold, Silver & Crystal}}.

==Plot==
{{spoilers}}
On {{rt|38|Johto}}, as [[Eusine]] prepares to fly with his {{p|Jumpluff}} to meet {{adv|Crystal}}, he hears a noise coming from [[Team Rocket Elite Trio|Harry]]. Eusine searches Harry and discovers the [[Clear Bell]].

On the [[Bell Tower|Tin Tower]], {{p|Suicune}} is sucked into the [[Heavy Ball]]. Crystal thinks that she has caught Suicune, but then it breaks the Heavy Ball, releasing itself. Crystal says that the reason that she used the Heavy Ball was Suicune's weight. However, she is not deterred and believes she must weaken Suicune further. Suicune jumps up onto a floor of the Tin Tower. She sends [[Archy]] and [[Bonee]] after it. Bonee uses {{m|False Swipe}}, but it appears to be blocked by Suicune's tails. Crystal yells encouragement to Bonee before finding that there is a translucent wall between Suicune and Bonee and also above her.

[[Eusine]], through the doll he gave her, informs her that Suicune is creating the Crystal Wall. He says that he is coming to her by following the doll's signal and that she needs to stop Suicune from completing the Crystal Wall. Crystal then sees that the Crystal Wall is almost complete. She helps Bonee stop the Crystal Wall with its bone. If Suicune completes the Crystal Wall, they will be blocked and Suicune will surely flee. However, they can pass through the Crystal Wall with the [[Clear Bell]] that Eusine stole from Harry. He deduces that they knew about the Clear Bell's effects.

As Eusine nears the Tin Tower, the Crystal Wall is completed, splintering Bonee's bone. The fragments break Eusine's doll, Crystal's [[Pokégear]], and makes one of Crystal's earrings fall off. Eusine is horrified to see Crystal fall off of the Tin Tower. Meanwhile, {{DL|Tower duo (Adventures)|Ho-Oh|a huge, shining, birdlike Pokémon}} flies by while leaving behind a rainbow above the clouds.

==Major events==
* [[Eusine]] discovers the [[Clear Bell]].
* {{adv|Crystal}} continues her battle with {{DL|Legendary beasts (Adventures)|Suicune}}.
* [[Bonee]]'s bone, Crystal's [[Pokégear]], and Eusine's doll are all broken.
* Crystal falls from the Tin Tower.
{{Adventuresevents}}
{{endspoilers}}

